      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td><b>Important:</b> You might want to use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentList" target="_blank">llGetAgentList</a> instead of using sensors to get a list of all avatars within the same parcel or region.</td>
      </tr>
